WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.573
(instrumental music)

00:00:01.573 --> 00:00:05.156
- I am Ernestine
Shepherd, 80 years of age.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:10.674
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:14.882
I bench press 110 pounds.

00:00:18.136 --> 00:00:20.553
I started training at age 71.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:27.307
I was named the oldest female
competitive body builder

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.507
at the Guinness Book of World Records.

00:00:36.129 --> 00:00:39.796
My sister and I started
exercising together.

00:00:41.689 --> 00:00:45.606
I had never done any type
of exercising before.

00:00:47.864 --> 00:00:51.001
Before she died, she said, promise me

00:00:51.001 --> 00:00:54.569
you will follow my dream and try to get

00:00:54.569 --> 00:00:57.857
in the Guinness Book of World Records.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.332
So, that's what I did.

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:02.343
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:05.760
I have been in six or seven competitions.

00:01:06.863 --> 00:01:10.530
I win, but some I come
out second and third,

00:01:12.382 --> 00:01:14.522
and I'm pleased with that.

00:01:14.522 --> 00:01:17.076
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.473
I'm up every morning at 2:30.

00:01:19.473 --> 00:01:22.497
After I have my devotions, I walk

00:01:22.497 --> 00:01:25.247
and I run approximately 10 miles.

00:01:26.646 --> 00:01:29.910
I'm at the gym at 7:30, and I have

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:32.493
a group of ladies that I train.

00:01:33.452 --> 00:01:34.619
Down, and one.

00:01:36.073 --> 00:01:37.490
I train all ages.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:43.456
One of the youngest, I think
she's about 20 years of age,

00:01:43.456 --> 00:01:47.289
and the rest go from 40,
all the way up to 80.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:53.893
(cheering and applause)

00:01:56.466 --> 00:02:00.224
When people come to my class
for the very first time,

00:02:00.224 --> 00:02:03.057
they are really, really surprised.

00:02:05.283 --> 00:02:08.390
They said, "I didn't think this exercise

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:12.507
"would be this tough,
but if you can do it,

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:14.924
"we are going to do it, too."

00:02:16.251 --> 00:02:20.418
I really don't feel as
though I'm 80 years of age,

00:02:21.455 --> 00:02:23.087
but I am!

00:02:23.087 --> 00:02:26.837
I want to keep training
until my day is done.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.403
(instrumental music)

